2025-07-27T10:41:02.511Z uid=mdljtkj3-g6psr8 input: {"model":"claude-3-5-haiku-20241022","max_tokens":512,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Please write a 5-10 word title the following conversation:\n\nUser: 看看今天 F1 几点开始\n\n        User: \n\n        \n        Claude: 今天（7月27日）是F1比利时大奖赛，在斯帕-弗朗科尔尚赛道举行，当地时间下午3点开始（英国时间下午2点）。\n\n        User: 中国时间绩点\n\n        User: \n\n        \n        Claude: 比利时现在是夏令时（UTC+2），中国是UTC+8，所以中国时间比比利时时间快6小时。\n\n比利时大奖赛当地时间下午3点开始，换算成中国时间是**晚上9点**开始。\n\n        User: 谢谢\n\n        \n        Claude: 不客气！\n\nRespond with the title for the conversation and nothing else."}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"Summarize this coding conversation in under 50 characters.\nCapture the main task, key files, problems addressed, and current status.","cache_control":{"type":"ephemeral"}}],"temperature":0,"metadata":{"user_id":"user_0674f9e96a6c5e050de49f53342e837222c8f1dab260b774b53fc38d75289482_account_fa53ab3b-5e51-48b8-bb25-03584f5a5194_session_a58d7187-f9b6-4fa7-8fcb-4e088d813e7a"},"stream":true,"betas":["oauth-2025-04-20","fine-grained-tool-streaming-2025-05-14"]}
