gs = ?,\n    58→        tokenLogs = ?,\n    59→        p1Config = ?,\n    60→        p2Config = ?,\n    61→        public = ?\n    62→      WHERE id = ? AND owner_id = ?\n    63→      RETURNING id`\n    64→    )\n    65→      .bind(\n    66→        gameResultToUpdate.winner,\n    67→        gameResultToUpdate.gameConfig,\n    68→        gameResultToUpdate.logs,\n    69→        gameResultToUpdate.violationLogs,\n    70→        gameResultToUpdate.tokenLogs,\n    71→        gameResultToUpdate.p1Config,\n    72→        gameResultToUpdate.p2Config,\n    73→        gameResultToUpdate.public ? 1 : 0,\n    74→        id,\n    75→        props.userId\n    76→      )\n    77→      .first();\n    78→\n    79→    return {\n    80→      success: Boolean(row),\n    81→      gameResult: {\n    82→        id: row?.id,\n    83→      },\n    84→    };\n    85→  }\n    86→}\n    87→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it looks malicious. If it does, you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer high-level questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我发现了两个需要更新的 API 端点：\n\n1. `game-result-create.ts` - 创建游戏结果时需要包含 featured 字段\n2. `game-result-update.ts` - 更新游戏结果时需要包含 featured 字段\n\n但是我需要考虑权限问题：只有管理员或特定用户应该能够设置 featured 字段。我应该：\n\n1. 在创建时，普通用户应该不能设置 featured 为 true，应该默认为 false\n2. 在更新时，只有特定权限的用户才能修改 featured 字段\n\n让我先更新这两个文件，然后可能需要考虑权限控制。但现在先假设通过 API 的权限控制在其他地方处理。","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RxLA812NnGdkd6iN3LWHhe","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/yanzhen/fiddle/llm-fighter/api/src/endpoints/game-result-create.ts","old_string":"    const row = await c.env.DB.prepare(\n      `INSERT INTO game_results (\n        id,\n\t\t\t\twinner,\n\t\t\t\tgameConfig,\n\t\t\t\tlogs,\n\t\t\t\tviolationLogs,\n\t\t\t\ttokenLogs,\n\t\t\t\tp1Config,\n\t\t\t\tp2Config,\n        public,\n        owner